      "Source": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Identifier for an upstream data feed. The canonical string is the value\nstored in `external_player_identities.source`,\n`external_team_identities.source`, and `provider_id_mappings.provider`.\n\nDistinct from a competition slug: one feed can serve many competitions,\nand one competition can be served by several feeds. Which feeds serve\nwhich competition is an internal routing detail.",
